        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Did you submit feedback through the app or through their site? &nbsp; This kind of reporting should be done through that instead of here.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I agree and that's the way I usually do it.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>At first I wanted to collect some information, if it's only related to Freedom Six AZ because I hadn't a lot of time to play SotM lately.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I wanted to report it to tomorrow and link this thread to provide as many information as I have until that moment^^</p>\n<p>As you maybe know from another thread of mine, I tend to discuss bugs before reporting them <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
